  E4_COMMIT_IMPLEMENTATION_IF_NEEDED -- "tests fail<br/>reimplement against the amended entry" --> E4_IMPLEMENT_TASK
  E4_FAILURES_EXIT --> E4_STOP
  E4_COMMIT_IMPLEMENTATION_IF_NEEDED -- "tests-red" --> E4_FAILURES_EXIT
